            "question": "Can I visit the showroom?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, by appointment only, Monday to Saturday from 4:30 pm to 9 pm. Our showroom is at 17A Olga Road, Maddington WA 6109. <a href=\"/pages/book-appointment\">Book a showroom visit</a> online or call 0450 960 543, and tell us which products you would like to see.</p>"
