        "1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you help with tiling as well as products?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. ETS provides professional tiling. Send your suburb, room details, approximate area and timing through our project enquiry form so we can discuss the scope.</p>"
          }
        },
        "2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I check product availability or delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Contact us with the product name, finish and quantity you need and we will confirm availability. Tapware, shower sets, towel rails and other small bathroom items ship free Australia-wide, and you can pick up from Maddington by appointment. See <a href=\"/pages/delivery-pickup\">Delivery &amp; pickup</a> and our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
